@namespace ActualChat.UI.Blazor.App.Components
@using System.Linq.Expressions
@using ActualChat.Chat
@inherits ComponentBase<AppUIHub>

<FormBlock Title="@L.JoinRequestAccess_Title" Class="with-input-radio">
    <InputRadioGroup
        TValue="JoinRequestAccess"
        Name="@Id"
        Value="@Value"
        ValueChanged="@ValueChanged"
        ValueExpression="@ValueExpression">
        @foreach (var (access, label, hint) in GetItems()) {
            var itemId = $"{Id}-{access}";
            <TileItem
                Class="@(Value == access ? "clickable selected" : "clickable")"
                Click="@(() => ValueChanged.InvokeAsync(access))">
                <Icon>
                    <FormRadio TValue="JoinRequestAccess" Id="@itemId" Name="@Id" Value="@access"/>
                </Icon>
                <Content>
                    <Label InputId="@itemId" Text="@label" IsRequired="true"></Label>
                </Content>
                <Caption>@hint</Caption>
            </TileItem>
        }
    </InputRadioGroup>
</FormBlock>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Id { get; set; } = "";
    [Parameter] public JoinRequestAccess Value { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<JoinRequestAccess> ValueChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public Expression<Func<JoinRequestAccess>>? ValueExpression { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public bool IsPlaceChat { get; set; }

    private IEnumerable<(JoinRequestAccess Access, string Label, string Hint)> GetItems()
    {
        yield return (JoinRequestAccess.Off, L.JoinRequestAccess_Off, L.JoinRequestAccess_OffHint);
        if (IsPlaceChat)
            yield return (JoinRequestAccess.PlaceMembers,
                L.JoinRequestAccess_PlaceMembers, L.JoinRequestAccess_PlaceMembersHint);
        yield return (JoinRequestAccess.SignedIn, L.JoinRequestAccess_SignedIn, L.JoinRequestAccess_SignedInHint);
        yield return (JoinRequestAccess.Anyone, L.JoinRequestAccess_Anyone, L.JoinRequestAccess_AnyoneHint);
    }
}
